---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="好用机场 - 首页" 
  description="好用机场是一个全新的博客"
>
  <section class="hero" style="text-align: center;">
    <div class="hero-glow"></div>
    <div class="page-shell" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding-top: 40px; padding-bottom: 40px;">
      <div class="hero-copy" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center;">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="margin: 0 auto 24px;"><span></span> 优中选优 · 实时更新</p>
        <h1>好用机场推荐<br><em>2026 好用 · 稳定 · 性价比的机场推荐</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-lead" style="max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">聚焦您的核心上网需求，为您精选多款稳定、高速且极具性价比的科学上网服务。<br>全方位覆盖香港、日本、美国等优质原生节点，完美解锁 Netflix 流媒体、ChatGPT 与 YouTube，让您畅享无界网络。</p>
        <div class="hero-actions" style="justify-content: center;">
          <a class="button" href="/recommend/">查看机场推荐 <span>→</span></a>
          <a class="button button-secondary" href="/buying-guide/">新手选购指南</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-note" style="justify-content: center; margin: 24px auto 0;"><i>✓</i> 评测数据客观透明，坚决抵制跑路机场</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="showcase-section">
    <div class="brand-card-premium">
      <div class="bcp-content-wrapper">
      <div class="bcp-header">
        <img src="/images/brands/weifeng.png" alt="微风" class="bcp-logo" onerror="this.src='data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI0OCIgaGVpZ2h0PSI0OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2U0ZTlmMiIvPjwvc3ZnPg=='" />
        <div class="bcp-title-area">
          <h2>微风 <span class="bcp-badge">👍 倾力推荐</span> <span class="bcp-rating">⭐ 4.8</span></h2>
          <p class="bcp-slogan">全 IPLC 线路，节点速率×1 · 不限速不限设备</p>
          <p class="bcp-coverage"><strong>📍 节点覆盖：</strong>香港、台湾、日本、新加坡、美国、英国</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bcp-grid">
        <div class="bcp-feature-box">
          <h4>⚡ 运行状态</h4>
          <ul>
            <li><span>30天在线率</span> <strong>99.9%</strong></li>
            <li><span>中位延迟</span> <strong>42ms</strong></li>
            <li><span>下载速率</span> <strong>50 MB/s</strong></li>
            <li><span>丢包率</span> <strong>0.1%</strong></li>
            <li><span>节点总数</span> <strong>61</strong></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bcp-feature-box">
          <h4>🎬 流媒体解锁</h4>
          <ul>
            <li><span>Netflix</span> <strong>✅</strong></li>
            <li><span>Disney+</span> <strong>✅</strong></li>
            <li><span>ChatGPT</span> <strong>✅</strong></li>
            <li><span>TikTok</span> <strong>✅</strong></li>
            <li><span>YouTube</span> <strong>✅</strong></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bcp-feature-box">
          <h4>💻 客户端支持</h4>
          <ul>
            <li><span>Windows</span> <strong>✅</strong></li>
            <li><span>macOS</span> <strong>✅</strong></li>
            <li><span>iOS</span> <strong>✅</strong></li>
            <li><span>Android</span> <strong>✅</strong></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bcp-feature-box">
          <h4>💳 支付方式</h4>
          <ul>
            <li><span>支付宝</span> <strong>✅</strong></li>
            <li><span>微信支付</span> <strong>✅</strong></li>
            <li><span>USDT</span> <strong>✅</strong></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bcp-feature-box">
          <h4>⚙️ 代理协议</h4>
          <ul>
            <li class="flex-start"><span>🔹</span> Shadowsocks</li>
            <li class="flex-start"><span>🔹</span> Vmess</li>
            <li class="flex-start"><span>🔹</span> Trojan</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bcp-feature-box">
          <h4>🤖 AI 解锁能力</h4>
          <ul>
            <li class="flex-start"><span>✅</span> ChatGPT</li>
            <li class="flex-start"><span>✅</span> Gemini</li>
            <li class="flex-start"><span>✅</span> Claude AI</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bcp-feature-box">
          <h4>🚀 线路类型</h4>
          <ul>
            <li class="flex-start"><span>⭐</span> IEPL 专线</li>
            <li class="flex-start"><span>⭐</span> IPLC 专线</li>
            <li class="flex-start"><span>⭐</span> BGP 中继</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bcp-feature-box">
          <h4>🎧 售后客服</h4>
          <ul>
            <li class="flex-start"><span>👩‍💻</span> 24/7 在线客服</li>
            <li class="flex-start"><span>✈️</span> TG 群组</li>
            <li class="flex-start"><span>🎫</span> 工单系统</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bcp-plans-wrapper">
        <table class="bcp-plans">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>套餐名称</th>
              <th>价格 (人民币)</th>
              <th>包含流量</th>
              <th>设备数</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>乘风 (Riding)</td>
              <td class="price-highlight">¥27.00</td>
              <td>200GB / 月</td>
              <td>不限</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>破风 (Breaking)</td>
              <td class="price-highlight">¥33.00</td>
              <td>500GB / 月</td>
              <td>不限</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>御风 (Mastery)</td>
              <td class="price-highlight">¥127.00</td>
              <td>1.2TB / 月</td>
              <td>不限</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>清风 (Breeze)</td>
              <td class="price-highlight">¥137.00</td>
              <td>100GB / 年</td>
              <td>不限</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>信风 · 不限时</td>
              <td class="price-highlight">¥108.00</td>
              <td>270GB / 一次性</td>
              <td>不限</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>长风 · 不限时</td>
              <td class="price-highlight">¥370.00</td>
              <td>570GB / 一次性</td>
              <td>不限</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="bcp-actions">
        <div class="bcp-promo">
          <span>🎁 本站专属优惠码</span>
          <div class="promo-code-group">
            <code>hM8APccJ</code>
            <button class="copy-code-btn" data-code="hM8APccJ" title="点击一键复制">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="https://edp01.breezenetaff.com/#/?code=hM8APccJ" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener noreferrer" class="button bcp-btn">
          前往官网注册 <span>↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style is:inline>
    .showcase-section {
      padding: 40px 0 80px 0;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .brand-card-premium {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 40px 0;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
      width: 100%;
      margin: 0 auto;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }
    .bcp-content-wrapper {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }
    .brand-card-premium:hover {
      box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(36, 87, 230, 0.08);
    }
    .brand-card-premium::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 6px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2457e6, #8b5cf6, #ec4899);
    }
    .bcp-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .bcp-logo {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      object-fit: cover;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      background: #f8fafc;
    }
    .bcp-title-area h2 {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      font-size: 2rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .bcp-badge {
      background: #fef2f2;
      color: #ef4444;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .bcp-rating {
      color: #f59e0b;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      background: #fffbeb;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .bcp-slogan {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 500;
      margin: 0 0 4px 0;
    }
    .bcp-coverage {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .bcp-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 32px 24px;
      margin: 32px 0;
      padding: 32px 0;
      border-top: 1px dashed var(--line);
      border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--line);
    }
    .bcp-feature-box h4 {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .bcp-feature-box ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .bcp-feature-box li {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      max-width: 180px; /* Keeps text and values perfectly aligned and close */
    }
    .bcp-feature-box li.flex-start {
      justify-content: flex-start;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .bcp-feature-box li strong {
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .bcp-plans-wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .bcp-plans {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      min-width: 600px;
    }
    .bcp-plans th, .bcp-plans td {
      padding: 16px 24px;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .bcp-plans th {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: #f8fafc;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .bcp-plans td {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .bcp-plans tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .price-highlight {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #2457e6 !important;
      font-size: 1.1rem !important;
    }
    .bcp-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      background: #f8fafc;
      padding: 24px 32px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .bcp-promo {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .bcp-promo span {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .promo-code-group {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      background: #fff;
      border: 2px dashed #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .promo-code-group code {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: #ef4444;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .copy-code-btn {
      background: none;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      color: var(--muted);
      padding: 4px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .copy-code-btn:hover {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .copy-code-btn.copied {
      color: #10b981;
    }
    .bcp-btn {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      padding: 16px 48px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(36, 87, 230, 0.2);
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .brand-card-premium { padding: 24px; }
      .bcp-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; }
      .bcp-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
      .bcp-actions { flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; align-items: stretch; text-align: center; }
      .promo-code-group { justify-content: center; }
      .bcp-btn { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
